{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1197040-incarnation-hero-the-will","id":1197040,"title":"Incarnation Hero, The Will","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-18T21:56:26-07:00","id":1197040,"title":"Incarnation Hero, The Will","content":"This is an adaptation of the family history of one of the characters in my superhero novel, Bystander. I haven't revealed it yet and she's not the main character.<br /> <br /> On the outside, Genevive Robles displays no supernatural abilities. Nor did any of her direct line of ancestors to take the path of the warrior. But all of them were nigh unbeatable until their last battle always against impossible odds. Always after they have had at least one child, though theories exist that a chosen heir may suffice. And always in the last battle their foes are thrown down along with them.<br /> <br /> The first was a Hittite, eventually the family became Egyptian, then Greek, then Roman, they were Romani gypsies for a time, then Spaniards, and then Latinos. They've never used the same martial style, often learning how to fight from other teachers. But they all learned the mantra:<br /> <br /> Skill surpasses power.<br /> Preparation surpasses skill.<br /> Will surpasses everything.<br /> <br /> From their perspective, there is little about this but luck and circumstance. They rarely concern themselves past the practical needs of the duties they take on and they always take on a duty. They always fight for a nation or a people or something. They themselves keep little more than others in the way of family histories. But there is a cult, descended from a brother of the first, that tracks and records the achievements of any inheritor of The Will. Robles is one of the few lines, perhaps the only one, that has passed on The Will with each generation and the cult feels that she is a holder of The Will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","user":"Thrythlind","date":". 03-19-2018, 01:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}